  "body": "There are two lines that seem to be at odds with each other.\r\nBy default a request should be using \"omit\" as the credentials mode  but in the Response Constructor, a fallback of \"same-origin\" should be used.\r\n\r\nShould these two lines sync up to say the same thing?\r\n\r\nhttps://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/4321ab66c7ecc73793229939eaaeb811333e6cab/#keep-alive-flag\r\n\r\n> A request has an associated credentials mode, which is \"omit\", \"same\\-origin\", or \"include\"\\. Unless stated otherwise, it is \"omit\"\\.\r\n\r\nhttps://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/4321ab66c7ecc73793229939eaaeb811333e6cab/#request-class\r\n\r\n> Set fallbackCredentials to \"same\\-origin\"\\.",
